            "notes": "Generally, you just take [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) and maybe replace [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) with [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016) If you have the cash. \n\nIf you got the MVP bonus, consider taking neither and going straight to [Zip Grease](item_f1f004d4-d091-42e9-b34e-2b12f56e82c6), the core item to your kit.",
