            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-09-26T16:57:38.172556+00:00",
            "notes": "The choice here is generally between [Soot Shaker](item_365d55fe-06c9-4600-8369-5f00bd0c5b19) and [Bingo!](item_1234b16b-1426-4a0c-b6c3-213180336cc6). \n\nI used to go for \"Bingo!\", but I think \"Soot Shaker\" synergizes better with the focus on [Zip Grease](item_f1f004d4-d091-42e9-b34e-2b12f56e82c6). It basically depends on if you want your Zip Greased shots to fire in a quicker burst, or if you want your direct hits to get you more conc mines to fire more Zip Greased shots. Additionally, \"Bingo!\" (and \"Bango!\") don't trigger on shields, so if you picked up \"Frags For Days\" first, \"Soot Shaker\" may be more beneficial for that reason, too.\n\nGet [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) if you haven't, and start loading your kit with blues that continue to increase Weapon Power. If you're dealing with airborne targets, consider [Spiked Gloves](item_70573d1b-b952-4418-a13f-5728ff472a07) and [Stratosphere Beacon](item_15bf2dc7-5161-47b0-929b-17cbb1d54182).",
